OL,3,GNEWSA'Perfect storm' could lead to
OL,4,Arubbish piling up on Scotland's
OL,5,Astreets, experts warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's waste sector is on the verge
OL,8,Fof a crisis which could see rubbish
OL,9,Fpiling up on the streets, experts have
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FThey say the combination of
OL,13,Fsignificantly reduced landfill space
OL,14,Fand a breakdown of Glasgow's main
OL,15,Fincinerator have created a "perfect
OL,16,Fstorm" which could see waste left
OL,17,Funcollected.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
