OL,3,GNEWSA'Perfect storm' could lead to
OL,4,Arubbish piling up on Scotland's
OL,5,Astreets, experts warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndustry representatives are due to
OL,8,Fmeet ministers to discuss their
OL,9,Fconcerns but say there's no obvious
OL,10,Fshort-term solution to avoid the
OL,11,Fcrisis.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government said was
OL,14,Fworking with stakeholders to maintain
OL,15,Fresilience and identify contingency
OL,16,Farrangements should they be required.
